  "body": "http://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/4137\n\n``` html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<body>\n<script>\nvar iframe = document.createElement(\"iframe\");\ndocument.body.appendChild(iframe);\niframe.onload = (e) => {\n  w(e);\n  w(e.target.contentDocument.URL);\n};\n//setTimeout(() => iframe.src = \"document\", 100)\niframe.src = \"document\";\n</script>\n```\n\nGecko and Blink dispatch only one `load` event; I can't figure out where the spec backs this up.\n",
